Q.6 Define the roles of a frontend developer, backend developer, and database administrator in a project.
Ans.
Frontend Developer: Designs and builds the user interface using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to ensure a good user experience.
Backend Developer: Manages server logic, APIs, and data handling to make the website function properly.
Database Administrator (DBA): Maintains, secures, and optimizes the database to ensure efficient data storage and access.

