Q.9 Research and list five web browsers. Explain how rendering engines differ between them.
Ans. 
Five Popular Web Browsers:
Google Chrome
Mozilla Firefox
Microsoft Edge
Safari
Opera

Rendering Engine Differences:
Google Chrome & Opera: Use Blink engine (fast, supports modern web standards).
Mozilla Firefox: Uses Gecko engine (focus on flexibility and open-source standards).
Microsoft Edge: Uses Blink (newer versions; older versions used EdgeHTML).
Safari: Uses WebKit engine (optimized for Apple devices and energy efficiency).

Different browsers use different engines to interpret HTML, CSS, and JS and display web pages, affecting performance and compatibility.

